---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /charters.html
title: "Fishing Charters & Prices in New Smyrna Beach | Reel Deal"
description: "Compare our New Smyrna Beach trips and prices: inshore from $475, nearshore, shark fishing, dolphin tours & seasonal glow tours. Private boat, gear included."
hero: day-a
---
<section class="hero hero--page">
  <img class="hero__img" src="/images/day-a.webp" alt="Family with their catch on the Reel Deal boat" fetchpriority="high">
  <div class="hero__in">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">Trips &amp; prices</p>
    <h1>Charter Fishing in New Smyrna Beach, FL</h1>
    <p class="sub-h">Private trips on a 22' Sundance skiff, your group only.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec__head">
      <p class="lead">Pick the water and the fish. Inshore trips work the Indian River Lagoon, Mosquito Lagoon and the Halifax River for redfish, snook and sheepshead. Nearshore and shark trips run out of Ponce Inlet, up to 6 miles off the beach. The dolphin tour is 2 slow hours on the lagoon.</p>
      <p>Every trip is private on Capt. Chad's 22' Sundance skiff, up to 6 guests, and every price below is for your whole group.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cards">
      {%- for t in trips %}
      <article class="card">
        <a class="card__img" href="{{ t.url }}"><img src="/images/{{ t.img }}.webp" alt="{{ t.alt }}" loading="lazy" width="800" height="600"><span class="card__tag{% if t.signature %} card__tag--red{% endif %}">{{ t.tag }}</span></a>
        <div class="card__body">
          <h2 style="font-size:1.6rem"><a href="{{ t.url }}" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit">{{ t.name }}</a></h2>
          {% if t.price %}<p class="card__meta">{{ t.price }} · {{ t.len }}</p>{% endif %}<p>{{ t.hook }}</p>
          <div class="card__links"><a class="btn btn--outline" href="{{ t.url }}">Learn More</a><a class="btn btn--red" href="{{ t.book }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ t.bookLabel or "Book Now" }}</a></div>
        </div>
      </article>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec sec--sand" id="prices">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec__head"><p class="eyebrow">Straight from our booking page</p><h2>Trip Prices</h2>
      <p>Every trip is private and the price is for your whole group. Each trip includes a set number of guests, with a small charge for each extra guest up to 6. The booking page shows the exact total for your group and the open dates.</p></div>
    <div class="ptable-wrap">
    <table class="ptable">
      <thead><tr><th scope="col">Trip</th><th scope="col">Length &amp; start</th><th scope="col">Price</th><th scope="col">Guests included</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        {%- for r in prices %}{% if r.trip %}
        <tr><th scope="row"><a href="{{ r.url }}">{{ r.trip }}</a></th><td>{{ r.length }}</td><td><strong>{{ r.price }}</strong></td><td>{{ r.guests }}</td></tr>{% endif %}
        {%- endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
    </div>
    <div class="btns"><a class="btn btn--red" href="{{ site.booking }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">See Dates &amp; Book</a><a class="btn btn--outline" href="{{ site.phoneHref }}">Call {{ site.phone }}</a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap details">
    <div class="box">
      <h3>Trip Lengths</h3>
      <ul class="ticks">
        <li><strong>2 hours:</strong> dolphin and manatee tours</li>
        <li><strong>3 hours:</strong> shark trips, morning or midday</li>
        <li><strong>4 hours:</strong> ideal for families, new anglers and quick hits</li>
        <li><strong>6 hours:</strong> go deeper, stay longer and chase bigger targets</li>
        <li><strong>Night tours:</strong> seasonal bioluminescence, when the glow is on</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>Launch Location</h3>
      <p>All trips depart from New Smyrna Beach, Florida, with quick access to the Indian River Lagoon, Mosquito Lagoon and the nearshore Atlantic. Staying in Daytona? See our <a href="/daytona-beach">Daytona Beach charters</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="box">
      <h3>What's Included</h3>
      <ul class="ticks">
        <li>All fishing gear, bait and tackle</li>
        <li>U.S. Coast Guard licensed captain</li>
        <li>Florida fishing license for everyone on board</li>
        <li>Fish cleaning available for most trips</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>What to Bring</h3>
      <ul class="ticks">
        <li>Snacks and drinks (no glass) and sunscreen (no spray)</li>
        <li>Polarized sunglasses</li>
        <li>Bug spray (especially for night trips)</li>
        <li>Gratuity for the crew</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="boat-training">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">For new boat owners</p>
      <h2>Private Boat Training &amp; On the Water Instruction</h2>
      <p>Reel Deal Fishin' offers one on one boat training for new and inexperienced boat owners. This hands on instruction helps you become more confident, comfortable and safe when operating your own boat.</p>
      <p>Training is customized to you and your boat and may include:</p>
      <ul class="ticks">
        <li><strong>Complete boat walkthrough:</strong> reviewing the boat from bow to stern, identifying important equipment and making sure you have the right safety and boating gear.</li>
        <li><strong>Pre launch preparation:</strong> what to check and prepare before arriving at the ramp.</li>
        <li><strong>Trailer backing:</strong> hands on instruction for confidently backing a trailer down the ramp and maneuvering in tight areas.</li>
        <li><strong>Launching the boat:</strong> procedures for safely and efficiently unloading the boat.</li>
        <li><strong>Loading the boat:</strong> approaching the trailer, loading the boat, securing it and preparing it for the road.</li>
        <li><strong>Ramp etiquette and parking:</strong> using the ramp efficiently, parking the truck and trailer and avoiding common mistakes.</li>
        <li><strong>Personalized instruction:</strong> training at your own pace with plenty of time to practice each skill.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Whether you just bought your first boat or want more confidence launching, loading, trailering and operating it, Capt. Chad can work with you one on one using your own boat and trailer. The goal is simple: help you leave confident enough to safely enjoy your boat on your own.</p>
      <div class="btns"><a class="btn btn--red" href="{{ site.phoneHref }}">Call to Schedule Training</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="split__media"><img src="/images/boat.webp" alt="The Reel Deal 22 foot Sundance skiff on calm, clear water" width="958" height="960" loading="lazy"></div>
  </div>
</section>
